## Usage

```python
from datetime import timedelta

import package_name

package_name.parse_duration("1h30m")  # timedelta(seconds=5400)
package_name.format_duration(timedelta(seconds=90))  # "1m30s"
```

Every error the library raises derives from `Error`. See
[docs/api.md](https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/blob/main/docs/api.md) for the full API.

