## Development

Requires [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) and make.

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `make install` | Create `.venv` and install the library and its dev tools |
| `make lint` / `make format` | Check / fix lint and formatting (ruff) |
| `make typecheck` | mypy strict |
| `make coverage` | Tests with the branch coverage floor |
| `make test-min` | Tests on the oldest supported Python |
| `make build` | Build the sdist and wheel and check their metadata |
| `make smoke` | Install the wheel in a clean environment, import it and type-check against it |

Run `make help` for the full list. Changes are recorded in [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md).

